</element-citation><mixed-citation id="mc-CR13" publication-type="journal">van der Reijd, D. J. et al. Multi-sequence MRI radiomics of colorectal liver metastases: which features are reproducible across readers? <italic>Eur. J. Radiol.</italic><bold>172</bold>, 111346. 10.1016/j.ejrad.2024.111346 (2024).<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">38309217</pub-id>
